==Battleground==
*1 [[Pigeon de Sable]] spawns after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Brollow]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
**12 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**12 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
**4 [[Tackey]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Mr. Mole]]s spawn, delay 50~60 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Note that [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] is fairly good here if you hit the base with it (for 4 crown) the resulting wave will instantly kill the first Brollows and Pigeon de Sables (assuming Slime Cat is level 30 or above.)

Anti-Floating tanks such as [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] and [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Kai μ]] will help immensely, and almost guarantee a win.

==Trivia==
*This level's name is likely a reference to its Mr. Mole.

